  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Design, monitor and evaluate supported WASH interventions implemented in Darfur is a component of Urban Water for Sudan (UW4S)  reported by FCDO with a funding type of 104 - Procurement of Services and a budget of &#xA3;71,734. It works in the following sector(s): Basic drinking water supply and basic sanitation, Water resources conservation (including data collection), Water sector policy and administrative management.</narrative>
